          "short": "$(a-2-\\sqrt3)(a-2+\\sqrt3)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(a-2)^2-3&=(a-2)^2-(\\sqrt3)^2\\\\(a-2)^2-3&=(a-2-\\sqrt3)(a-2+\\sqrt3)\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 27
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q1-p",
        "type": "part",
