          "short": "$(x+1-\\sqrt7)(x+1+\\sqrt7)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(x+1)^2-7&=(x+1)^2-(\\sqrt7)^2\\\\(x+1)^2-7&=(x+1-\\sqrt7)(x+1+\\sqrt7)\\end{align*}$$",
